cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenHarness in research or production, cite this repository."
title: OpenHarness
abstract: >-
  OpenHarness is the deterministic control plane for agent harnesses. It
  declares an agent harness, records it in a content-addressed lockfile, checks
  drift before merge, and emits bounded receipts that compose across audit,
  evaluation, telemetry, inventory, failure classification, and policy.
type: software
authors:
